listing:   gemm_plain.cu and wmma_tile.cu
toolchain: Cuda compilation tools, release 12.0, V12.0.140
command:   nvcc -arch=sm_80 -cubin gemm_plain.cu -o .tmp_g.cubin && nvcc -arch=sm_80 -cubin wmma_tile.cu -o .tmp_w.cubin && echo '--- gemmNaive (gemm_plain.cu): floating-point math instructions, counted' && cuobjdump -sass .tmp_g.cubin | grep -o -E '(FFMA|FMUL|FADD|HMMA[.A-Z0-9]*)' | sort | uniq -c && echo '--- tile16 (wmma_tile.cu): floating-point math instructions, counted' && cuobjdump -sass .tmp_w.cubin | grep -o -E '(FFMA|FMUL|FADD|HMMA[.A-Z0-9]*)' | sort | uniq -c
date:      2026-10-09T19:27:40Z
machine:   Linux x86_64 (cloud build container)
hardware:  compiled only: no GPU is needed to read generated code
exit code: 0
